{"id":"gwjyvkb5hy1uf31fy08i5pndh","title":"广东华兴银行、吉林银行及泸州银行大额股权司法拍卖启动","originalTitle":"多笔银行大额股权公开拍卖！什么情况？","summary":"广东华兴银行3.12亿股股权（占比3.9%）将于阿里资产平台拍卖，起拍价4.5亿元；吉林银行1.7亿股股权（占比1.23%）起拍价4.403亿元；泸州银行11.97%股权起拍价4.57亿元。三案例均涉及司法处置，其中吉林银行股权曾于2025年10月流拍，泸州银行股权系破产清算后处置。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"东方财富"},"links":{"original":"http://bank.eastmoney.com/news/1174,202611193934967217.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T05:46:49.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T07:35:30.440Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T07:35:30.440Z","category":"macro","tags":["行情异动"],"score":64,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}